# Line-ending policy.
#
# Shell scripts MUST use LF: they execute on the Linux VPS, and CRLF makes
# bash fail with "syntax error: unexpected end of file" (it reads `fi\r` as a
# command rather than the keyword). `git archive` is the deploy transport and
# applies these attributes, so this keeps deploys correct no matter what
# core.autocrlf is set to on the machine doing the deploy.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
